OL,3,CWoman dies after Limavady road crash
OL,5,FA woman in her 50s has died following
OL,6,Fa road crash in Co Londonderry.
OL,8,FPolice have appealed for information
OL,9,Ffollowing the collision in the
OL,10,FDrumrane Road area of Limavady at
OL,11,Faround 2.50pm on Sunday.
OL,13,FThe crash involved a car and a
OL,14,Fpedestrian.
OL,16,FThe PSNI said: "Officers, along with
OL,17,Fcolleagues from the Northern Ireland
OL,18,FAmbulance Service, attended and
OL,19,Fmedical treatment was provided at the
OL,20,Fscene.
