OL,3,CWoman dies after Limavady road crash
OL,5,F"However, sadly, the woman passed away
OL,6,Ffrom her injuries a short time later.
OL,8,F"The Drumrane Road, which was closed
OL,9,Ffor a time, has since reopened.
OL,11,FEnquiries are continuing.JCatch up
